Z||000000||Standard||03-14-2001||11:25 PM||||Here's the pics of my still uncompleted sub-box... the pics didn't turn out that well and scanning them didn't help much either.  Freakin' camera... hopefully I'll be gettin' a digital camera in a little bit here.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/install_start.jpg"> <BR>Pioneer GM-X542 amp, fiberglass cloth and resin and my Pioneer 10" sub<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/form_in_car.jpg"> <BR>Gettting the form of the footwell.. it's hard to tell but it is in the car right now  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/foam.jpg"> <BR>waaaay too much foam.  I had trouble getting it to stick onto the sides of the form.  I think a better way would be to do a little bit at a time instead of trying to do it all at once..<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fiberglass_start.jpg"> <BR>The start of the fiberglassing.  I thought I had taken more pics after I got the box almost done, bit I guess not...<P><P>------------------<BR>Everybody wants a normal life and a cool car.. <B>Most people settle for the car</B><P>I'm not dumb.  I just have a command of thoroughly useless information<BR>        <BR>AOL: LastMinuteBastrd<BR>AIM: SavedByJebus    -- you'll understand if you watch The Simpsons :D||||reg||7
